 /opt/librowise/venv bundles the Python dependencies listed in the
 project's pyproject.toml (FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, Alembic, Pydantic, Uvicorn,
 Jinja2, psycopg and others). Each package's licence is included in its
 *.dist-info directory under /opt/librowise/venv/lib.

